{'symbol': 'JNJ', 'date': '2022-04-19 06:20:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON & JOHNSON ANNOUNCES DIVIDEND INCREASE OF 6.6%', 'text': 'NEW BRUNSWICK, N.J. , APRIL 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JOHNSON & JOHNSON (NYSE: JNJ) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A 6.6% INCREASE IN THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, FROM $1.06 PER SHARE TO $1.13 PER SHARE.'}